oleysa: Cordelle, mm, yes. I remember you. We spoke on the phone.
oleysa: My name is Oleysa. And this shift, you'll be answering to me.
oleysa: It's a shame... had we met in the morning, we may have gotten to speak to eachother. But there is work to do now.
oleysa: You'll be restocking the pastries. Go.
